      "writtenOn": "2023-06-20T15:18:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, that makes sense. I could update the TextureProxy callsite to call isCompatible on TextureInfo instead of the \u003d\u003d operator in SkAssert, would that be better?",
