      "message": "Do we need to have `isSpecCompatible` be distinct from a more all-inclusive `TextureInfo::isCompatible` method? For instance, I\u0027m wondering if we should be taking mipmapping and protected status into account for compatibility. The main thing is we want to allow supersets of usages to fulfill a promise\u0027d texture info, right?",
